# Build and test

## Default (no local Go)

```sh
make test    # race detector
make vet
make fmt
make build   # writes ./gourl (gitignored)
make image && make run
```

`ENGINE=podman` works. Cache lives in ignored `.cache/`.

## Local Go 1.26+

```sh
go test -race ./...
go run ./cmd/gourl --data-dir ./data --timeout 30s
```

## Docker run notes

Always `-it` and `-e TERM`. Named volume `gourl-data:/data`. Linux host APIs: `--network host` or `host.docker.internal`. Image user UID 10001.

## Safety

Never commit `data/`, `.cache/`, or real tokens. Corrupt `state.json` must fail startup — do not auto-overwrite.
